  resolver) by module, team, component, year and repo with Fairlearn's MetricFrame and flags slices
  that fall below overall (the slices here are tiny, so few or none clear the bar). The 'core'
  module is unowned: its author has no team in 180 days, and the 730-day lookback variant owns it.
  Real-run findings, the mitigation chosen and its trade-offs: BIAS.md.

